  "avQSavVsBav": "SAV vs BAV",
  "avABody": "Ashtakavarga Vedic astrology mein points par based ek strength system hai. Har planet apni position ke hisaab se barah rashiyon ko benefic points (bindus, jinhe rekha bhi kehte hain) deta hai. Kisi rashi mein jitne zyada points honge, related planetary dasha aur transit ke dauraan life ka wo area utna hi smooth support paayega.",
  "avSavBody": "SAV (Sarva Ashtakavarga) saaton planets ke points ko har rashi ke liye jod deta hai. Ye har rashi ke liye ek hi strength score deta hai, jisse aap jaldi dekh sakte hain ki aapki chart mein kaunsi rashiyan — aur unke houses — sabse zyada supported hain.",
  "avBavBody": "BAV (Bhinna Ashtakavarga) ek single planet ke points ko barah rashiyon mein dikhata hai. Ye batata hai ki koi specific planet kaunsi rashiyon ko sabse zyada support karta hai, jo tab important hota hai jab us planet ki dasha ya transit active ho.",
  "avHowToReadBody": "Zyada number better hote hain. SAV ke liye, average rashi lagbhag 28 points score karti hai — 30 se upar strong hai aur 25 se neeche care ki zaroorat hai. BAV ke liye, har rashi 0 se 8 ke beech hoti hai, jisme 4 average maana jaata hai. Important kaamon ke liye apni strongest rashiyon ko favour karein, aur weakest rashiyon ke matters mein patience aur discipline rakhein.",
  "avSavVsBavBody": "SAV saare planets ka combined total hai aur ek rashi ki overall strength dikhata hai. BAV ek single planet ka contribution hai aur batata hai ki kaunsa planet us rashi ko support karta hai. Big picture samajhne ke liye SAV use karein, aur ye jaanne ke liye ki kaunsa planet rashi ki strength drive karta hai, BAV dekhein.",
  "avSummaryInsight": "Aapki chart {s1}, {s2} aur {s3} mein sabse strong hai. Ye rashiyan planetary periods aur transits ke dauraan better support deti hain. {weak} mein abhi sabse kam support hai, isliye isse jude matters mein patience aur discipline madad karega.",
  "avBavInsight": "{planet} {s1} aur {s2} ke through sabse strong perform karta hai. Jab ye rashiyan activate hoti hain, tab {planet} se related matters improve hote hain.",
  "avInsightStrong": "Aapki strongest rashiyan {s1} aur {s2} hain — jab planets inhe transit karein tab important beginnings ke liye inhe favour karein.",
  "avInsightWeak": "{s1} mein sabse kam support hai — iske matters mein carefully aage badhein aur zyada commitment se bachein.",
  "avInsightBestPlanet": "{planet} ke paas sabse zyada points hain, isliye iske significations aapki life mein achhi tarah supported hain.",
  "avInsightWeakPlanet": "{planet} ke paas sabse kam points hain aur remedies aur conscious effort se sabse zyada benefit paata hai.",
  "avInsightAverage": "Jo rashiyan aapke average {avg} points se upar score karti hain, wo aam taur par smoother aur zyada reliable results deti hain.",
